{"id":"m1-u06","level":"m1","order":6,"title":{"en":"Describing places","fr":"Décrire des lieux","es":"Describir lugares","ar":"وصف الأماكن"},"tip":{"en":"Describe a place with 'There is...' and 'It is...'. Adjectives help: 'a quiet village', 'a crowded, noisy city'. Compare places with 'bigger than', 'more beautiful than' and 'the most...'.","fr":"Décrivez un lieu avec « Il y a... » et « C'est... ». Les adjectifs aident : « un village tranquille », « une ville bruyante et bondée ». Comparez avec « plus grand que », « plus beau que » et « le plus... ».","es":"Describe un lugar con «Hay...» y «Es...». Los adjetivos ayudan: «un pueblo tranquilo», «una ciudad ruidosa y llena de gente». Compara con «más grande que», «más bonito que» y «el más...».","ar":"صف المكان بعبارات مثل «يوجد...» و«إنه...». تساعدك الصفات: «قرية هادئة» و«مدينة مزدحمة وصاخبة». قارن بـ«أكبر من» و«أجمل من» و«الأكثر...»."},"words":40,"lessons":[{"id":"m1-u06-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"city, village, countryside","fr":"ville, village, campagne","es":"ciudad, pueblo, campo","ar":"مدينة، قرية، ريف"},"count":11},{"id":"m1-u06-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"suburb, neighbourhood, square","fr":"banlieue, quartier, place","es":"afueras, barrio, plaza","ar":"ضاحية، حي، ساحة"},"count":10},{"id":"m1-u06-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"market, old town, monument","fr":"marché, vieille ville, monument","es":"mercado, casco antiguo, monumento","ar":"سوق، المدينة القديمة، معلم أثري"},"count":11},{"id":"m1-u06-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"mountain, valley, forest","fr":"montagne, vallée, forêt","es":"montaña, valle, bosque","ar":"جبل، وادي، غابة"},"count":10},{"id":"m1-u06-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"beach, desert, island","fr":"plage, désert, île","es":"playa, desierto, isla","ar":"شاطئ، صحراء، جزيرة"},"count":11},{"id":"m1-u06-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"beautiful, quiet, crowded","fr":"beau, tranquille, bondé","es":"bonito, tranquilo, abarrotado","ar":"جميل، هادئ، مزدحم"},"count":10},{"id":"m1-u06-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"modern, ancient, historic","fr":"moderne, ancien, historique","es":"moderno, antiguo, histórico","ar":"عصري، قديم، تاريخي"},"count":11},{"id":"m1-u06-l8","type":"learn","order":8,"title":{"en":"tiny, famous, popular","fr":"minuscule, célèbre, populaire","es":"diminuto, famoso, popular","ar":"صغير جدا، مشهور، شعبي"},"count":10},{"id":"m1-u06-l9","type":"story","order":9,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"m1-u06-l10","type":"review","order":10,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":9}]}
